
>> Product := Into entsha.
Product xa-kufika: ['a'] yenza: { :price
	Imveliso bhala: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product entsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Imveliso bhala: [' cent a piece.'].


Inani xa-kufika: ['X'] yenza: { :b
	b × ngokwakho. 
}.
7 X { :i Imveliso bhala: i. }.
